  "rules": {
    "shield": "Lion block-consumption attack core at front with block training; warden/banner/cliff support, archon reborn terminal. HP and power remain distinct.",
    "sacrifice": "Void consumes only real eligible rattle/reborn/summon fodder; ritualist gets fodder immediately ahead and actual high-attack recipient. Reaper/ritualist fallback; never sacrifice mature non-fodder core. No forced void.",
    "shared": "Current visible supply/enemy only; legal APIs and shared upgrade offers. Real bodies are fallback. No master/dancer/choreo purchases. Retain invested natural core unless an uninvested stronger role arrives. No forcing six tier. Formation accounts for taunt protecting only next position; rotation deliberately cycles bodies. General and reward choice use visible owned role.",
    "splash": "Train attack on real splash/charge-splash core; breaker strips armor. Mature core retained. Mankator stays immediately before rear splash core; front guard otherwise protects core.",
    "burn": "Train power only cast/charge burn applicator, attack on independent body. Keep bloodcaller plus real burn source, protect caster; passive burn never receives assumed power scaling.",
    "rotation": "Use multiple naturally rotating bodies; train primary attack and spread HP floor before core. Shield leads, hourglass/caliber support current cycling. No stationary taunt dependency.",
    "duel": "Train real duelist attack/HP, prefer same-slot enemy with lowest visible HP/armor/attack when assigning core. Front guard can protect slot1 duelist, otherwise sufficient HP rather than fictional global taunt.",
    "spell": "Train actual damage caster power, use solus adjacent to main caster and other caster; attack goes useful independent body. No attack-to-power fiction.",
    "retaliation": "Thorns/bear/retaliation front gets HP/block, healer gets power, independent damage body gets attack. Thorns damage never assumes attack/power scaling. Defensive fallback retained until real retaliation unit appears."
  },
